{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1755-p1","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"坼（chè）：分裂。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11208-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"乾坤：指日月。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11208-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"戎马关山北：指战事起于北部边境地区。当时吐蕃正侵扰陇右、关中一带。戎马，战马，代指战争。关山，在今宁夏南部。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11208-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"凭轩：倚窗。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11208-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"涕泗（sì）：眼泪鼻涕。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11208-5"}],"blocks":[{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"登岳阳楼","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"runs":[{"text":"杜 甫","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"昔闻洞庭水，今上岳阳楼。\n\n吴楚东南坼","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11208-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，乾坤","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11208-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"日夜浮。\n\n亲朋无一字，老病有孤舟。\n\n戎马关山北","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11208-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，凭轩","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11208-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"涕泗","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11208-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"流。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"这首诗开篇虽只是平平的交代，却蕴含着强烈的今昔对比之感。接下来描绘洞庭湖分断吴楚、吐纳日月，写出它极其恢宏的气象。后四句转写孤舟老病之身世，看似悲戚，可对国家安危、时局动荡的忧思尽在其中，由此可见作者心胸之博大。诵读这首诗，要留意诗人困顿的处境，感受他痛切的心情，更要理解他心系天下的胸怀。可以拓展阅读《客至》等杜甫其他作品，进一步了解杜甫诗歌多样化的艺术风格。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11208-1","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"dis